---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Sunbeam Consulting" description="Diana Pfeil. MIT PhD, ex-Amazon, 2x startup CTO. AI strategy and fractional leadership for startups.">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">About Sunbeam Consulting</h1>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">
        <!-- Photo placeholder -->
        <div class="md:col-span-1">
          <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 text-sm overflow-hidden">
            <img
              src="/images/diana-headshot.jpg"
              alt="Diana Pfeil"
              class="w-full rounded-xl"
              onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span class=\'text-slate-400 text-sm\'>Photo coming soon</span>'"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Story -->
        <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            I'm <strong class="text-slate-900">Diana Pfeil</strong>. I've spent 20+ years in machine
            learning, starting with recommender systems at Amazon, finishing a PhD at MIT, and
            serving twice as a startup CTO (Pex, Lumo). I've shipped ML and AI products in travel,
            digital rights, fintech, health, and insurance.
          </p>

          <p>
            I started <strong class="text-slate-900">Sunbeam</strong> because I kept watching the
            same pattern from the outside that I'd lived from the inside: smart founders under
            investor pressure, teams building demos that never shipped, AI roadmaps that read more
            like wish-lists than plans. I'd lived every failure mode myself: vague targets, endless
            experiments, the widening gap between ambition and what we'd actually delivered.
          </p>

          <p>
            The difference between AI that ships and AI that fizzles is rarely the model.
            It's whether anyone's defined what success looks like. It's whether the team
            has a rhythm for working under uncertainty. It's whether the right skills are
            in the room. That's what I help teams build. And I love this stuff,
            so I try to bring a spirit of fun and momentum to the work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Credentials -->
      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Background</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">20+ Years in ML and AI</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">From recommendation systems to GenAI and LLMs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Ex-Amazon</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Software engineer for recommendation systems</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">2x Startup CTO</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Pex and Lumo, teams from 1 to 75 engineers</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">MIT PhD</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Operations Research and Machine Learning</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What it's like -->
      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">What It's Like to Work With Me</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700">
          <p>
            I'm direct, warm, and allergic to jargon. I set high standards and help your
            team get there.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm relentlessly efficient. I help you make decisions and forward progress
            fast, so your AI work delivers value your board, investors, and customers
            can see.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dianampfeil/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-sunbeam-600 hover:text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold text-sm"
        >
          LinkedIn &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection />
</BaseLayout>
